00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:28.979
Yeah, I know it's not really in the Ring City, but it was added with the Ring City patch

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:33.450
Ornsteins plume, thanks to a small change.org petition

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.570
