00:08:43.599 --> 00:08:51.179
Another thing added with the patch was these humanity sprite icons which signifies which bonfire location is the most active

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:57.239
So whether it's for PVP or for co-op use these to your advantage. Number 14

00:08:57.610 --> 00:09:01.979
one area you can't access despite it being plastered everywhere as

