I'm sure a bunch of you guys did this too. It's the end of the game you have to drag it out somehow

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:27.380
Number 17 the big question is what exactly does Filianore's egg represent and how

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:33.680
Exactly does it add obscure the pygmy [lords] and the dark soul and this end of the world scene

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:38.599
And it's fairly well established that wherever this is it's in the future for example

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:44.419
Gael's weaponry is incredibly worned the pygmy lords have heard rumors of a red hood

